{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
Damaging a {c_important}{u}Vulnerable{/u}{/c} enemy removes the {c_important}{u}Vulnerable{/u}{/c} and then Stuns them and surrounding enemies for {c_random}[{SF_0}|2|]{/c} seconds. This Stun applies {c_number}[{SF_10}*100|%|]{/c} more Stagger to Bosses.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if}

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Gain {c_number}[{SF_12}*100|x%|]{/c} Vulnerable Damage, increased by  {c_number}[{SF_6}|x2%|]{/c} for each {c_number}[1|%|]{/c} of Crowd Control Duration Bonus you have, up to a maximum of {c_random}[{SF_20}*100|x2%|]{/c}.
Current Bonus: {c_number}[{SF_5}*100|x2%|]{/c}{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
